<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Ahmsa started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Ahmsa started as hold.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell started coverage of Mexican steel firm Altos Hornos de Mexico SA (Ahmsa) with a hold rating, the brokerage said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Considering its high debt level, capacity constraints and a steady to soft outlook for steel prices, we think the share price is fairly valued,&quot; analysts Leonardo Simpser and Shayne McGuire wrote in the report.</p>
<p>Ahmsa traded at 16.34 pesos this morning, off six centavos.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
